### US-009: Multi-session terminal streaming
Status: in_progress
Depends on: US-002, US-006

Description:
As a user, I want multiple terminal sessions that stream stdout and stderr.

Acceptance Criteria:
- [ ] Create, switch, and close terminal sessions
- [ ] Separate stdout and stderr streams in the UI
- [ ] Example: run `npm test` and see stdout/stderr separated
- [ ] Negative case: session disconnect shows a reconnect prompt


